<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>上下文管理 on ByF (BaiFan) · 每日深度思考</title><link>https://blog.baifan.site/tags/%E4%B8%8A%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%87%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86/</link><description>Recent content in 上下文管理 on ByF (BaiFan) · 每日深度思考</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>blog@baifan.site (ByF (BaiFan))</managingEditor><webMaster>blog@baifan.site (ByF (BaiFan))</webMaster><copyright>CC BY-NC 4.0</copyright><lastBuildDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 16:25:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.baifan.site/tags/%E4%B8%8A%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%87%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>多 Agent 协作的技术内核：价值来自结构，不是并发</title><link>https://blog.baifan.site/multi-agent-technical-core/</link><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 14:33:59 +0800</pubDate><author>blog@baifan.site (ByF (BaiFan))</author><guid>https://blog.baifan.site/multi-agent-technical-core/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;多 Agent 系统的实际收益从不源于节点数量的盲目堆叠，而取决于拓扑结构的工程约束。缺乏严格职责边界与通信契约的多 Agent 系统只是昂贵的低效并发——成倍消耗 Token 并在链路中放大模型幻觉；具备分层委派、状态隔离与确定性验证闭环的架构，才是可工程化的复杂系统。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>上下文压缩的物理代价：KV Cache 压力、注意力衰减与有损摘要</title><link>https://blog.baifan.site/claude-code-context-compression/</link><pubDate>Sat, 23 May 2026 09:00:00 +0800</pubDate><author>blog@baifan.site (ByF (BaiFan))</author><guid>https://blog.baifan.site/claude-code-context-compression/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;大模型在物理底层不存在真正意义上的生物记忆，只有在显卡高带宽内存（HBM）中随序列长度线性堆叠的 Key-Value Cache，以及在数学上随序列拉长而被急剧稀释的注意力权重分布。Claude Code 呈现给开发者的所谓长程对话能力，本质上是一套在硬件显存与精度边界夹缝中运行的缓存逐出流水线，伴随着不可逆的信息失真与前缀失效代价。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>基于 MCP 的 Claude Skills 渐进式披露实现</title><link>https://blog.baifan.site/mcp-claude-skills-progressive-disclosure/</link><pubDate>Fri, 26 Dec 2025 14:00:00 +0800</pubDate><author>blog@baifan.site (ByF (BaiFan))</author><guid>https://blog.baifan.site/mcp-claude-skills-progressive-disclosure/</guid><description>&lt;figure&gt;&#10; &lt;img&#10; class="my-0 rounded-md"&#10; loading="lazy"&#10; decoding="async"&#10; fetchpriority="auto"&#10; alt="Claude Code Skill in Anywhere"&#10; width="2560"&#10; height="1440"&#10; src="https://blog.baifan.site/pictures/note/claudecodeskills_hu_3030e75c3d7e5ea7.png"&#10; srcset="https://blog.baifan.site/pictures/note/claudecodeskills_hu_3030e75c3d7e5ea7.png 800w,/pictures/note/claudecodeskills_hu_48299efe0d2363fe.png 1280w"&#10; sizes="(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 65vw"&#10; data-zoom-src="https://blog.baifan.site/pictures/note/claudecodeskills.png"&#10; /&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;figcaption&gt;Claude Code Skill in Anywhere&lt;/figcaption&gt;&#10; &lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;将专业知识与流程规范封装为模块化技能包并在推理时按需加载，是控制模型初始上下文体积并保持长任务稳定性的关键手段。基于标准 MCP 协议构建动态能力加载层，能够让任意兼容客户端在无需原生技能树支持的前提下实现渐进式披露。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>